    <Entry Name="SprintMode_Info_1">Yugurish uchun $Input{Run} ni bosing. Yurishni toʻxtating yoki $Input{Run} ni yana bosing.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="SprintMode_Info_2">Yugurish uchun $Input{Run} ni bosing. Toʻxtash uchun $Input{Run} ni yana bosing.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="UseItemMode">Buyumdan foydalanish rejimi</Entry>
